This project has not completed Claude Code setup.

While this file exists, a PreToolUse hook denies edits to project source files: the harness
refuses to start work on a codebase whose context has not been laid out yet.

Run /setup. Its last step runs .claude/setup/release.sh, which deletes this file, the setup
hooks and the setup skill, and unwires them from settings.json.

To abandon setup instead, run .claude/setup/release.sh yourself. Nothing else in the bundle
depends on it.
